{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEED THE QUEEN is a short active incremental game with a focus on strategic play and synergy-building. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and manage the Queen's colony, hatching a wide variety of specialized workers of unique shapes and sizes to tackle the different jobs around the hive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct unique buildings and hatch various types of workers,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce, gather, combine different types of foods; all with different values and attributes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply status effects for unique improvements,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Grey Matter, a limited resource used to unlock the most advanced upgrades,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and spend DNA points in the genetics talent tree,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, experiment and perfect  different builds,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the Queen to advance the species to the next step of its evolution!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135750?t=1762796423","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135750?t=1762796423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/3fa186b2c8e579d6363f1909c3ce642b2e8c69e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762796423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/3fa186b2c8e579d6363f1909c3ce642b2e8c69e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762796423","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description